Package: cinminai-sandbox
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), bubblewrap, passt
Description: Cin-MinAI sandbox for trying commands safely
 Lets the Cin-MinAI assistant try a command it suggested before you run it:
 on a throwaway copy of your folder, without root, without access to the rest
 of your files, your desktop or your system, and with only a private network.
 Your files aren't touched; you see what would happen, then decide.
